<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala cuts conversion price of convertibles.</title>
<headline>Ayala cuts conversion price of convertibles.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The conversion price of Ayala Corp convertible preferred shares will be cut to 21.60 pesos per common B shares starting May 6 from the present 27 pesos, issue manager BPI Capital Corp said on Monday.</p>
<p>May 6 is the ex-dividend date of the 25 percent stock dividend for the Ayala Corp's common shares.</p>
<p>An Ayala official said the new price was adjusted to cover the dilution effect of the stock dividend.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
